@startuml
actor Client
participant "Trade Store API" as API
database "SQL database" as DB

Client -> API: POST /trades
API -> DB: Atomic upsert if incoming version >= stored version
alt Incoming version is lower
    DB --> API: No row updated
    API --> Client: 409 Conflict
else Version is equal or higher
    DB --> API: Trade stored
    API --> Client: 201 Created / 200 OK
end
@enduml
